cff-version: 1.2.0
title: bioelectronics_toolkit
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Guangqing
    family-names: Yang
    email: guangqing@uchicago.edu
    affiliation: The University of Chicago
abstract: >-
  Desktop GUIs and a lightweight Flask web app for processing data from common
  bioelectronics and electrophysiology instruments — patch-clamp recordings
  (Axon .abf), Intan .rhd EMG, fluorescence imaging (TIFF / LIF),
  electrochemistry photocurrent and photovoltage, histology naming, and a
  quartz-crystal-microbalance monitor.
keywords:
  - bioelectronics
  - electrophysiology
  - patch-clamp
  - EMG
  - fluorescence
  - electrochemistry
  - ABF
  - RHD
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/guangqingy/bioelectronics_toolkit
version: 0.5.0
date-released: "2026-05-14"
